    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee malaykamoodá' nee aníng aga axweesaan án iri i hardáh sagaáwa tsare, iri tleés adór hee kur tleemamisi baraá gu'uteero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng iri yaahaás, iri báy, «Gár ta ara'aan a milá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án niri oó', «Gár naa ár a kitángw tsaa'asi kay qamin oo taa tleéhh ar sahaábu, gawaawose i búklír kón, nee tsaa'asór faanqw gawaawose taámboó faanqw i deer oo di/tá huwahuúw amór tsaa'asoodá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee dír bihhaá kitangwdae xaa'aá tsár awa seituúni i dayá', oo wák bihhaá doó /iyáy awa búkli nee oo hatlá' bihhaá doó basáy.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng malaykamoodá' nee án axweesá' nguri báw, «Aá aakooeé', muruuwí a milá?»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaykamoodá' nee án axweesá', iri báy, «Gár muruuwí i laqaqan a xu'káhe?» Aníng niri oó', «Aasla'áy aakooeé'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng iri báy, «Gaarí an axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar aa oó' dír Serubabeli iwa kaahi, ‹Arba/ati a sleeraaká ar /uuruuwók, laqaá ar aleesleemuuwók kilós, ala an sleér ar /uuruú qeeruueé'.› Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo tí an káh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tloomarí tlerantleer a gár milá dír Serubabeliwo? Kuúng Serubabeli tloomadá' an xatsa tléhh, inós tlaa/anooduú alhhe'eesaay oo do' tlehhit gun qaas, muu sleémeero iri urur'uus, tari oin, ‹Gurtleemu, gurtleemu› as do'odá'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngiri malé axaás i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Dabaá Serubabeli iihhafiirír do'owí ngina qaasiyé', nee dabaawós do'owí ngun alhhe'eesiyá', kuungá' kari tsahhá' adór án AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo ira amorhúng i ya/aáw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma heé gadiyér ninakw gaa waaqaa' gu qwal/ás, inooín Serubabeli ku ar iwa Doó Munguú tleehhi, tari qwalaa/. Tsaa'asoorí faanqw a ilaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ awa xumiisá' umuú diiro baraá yaamu sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo nguri báw, «Xaaiiká tsár awa seituúni kuqá' bihhaá /iya nee kuqá' bihhaá basa gár i laqaqana' a milá?» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng nguri yaahaás sagaáwa tsare, nguri báw, «Haleemooká' tsár awa seituúni gár i laqaqana' a milá? Kuká' bihhaá impirmaá sahaábuú i diriiá', kudá' di/tá huwahuwá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
